OL,4,BGlasner criticises Forest players yet  
OL,5,Bto learn English                       
OL,6,GNottingham Forest manager Oliver       
OL,7,GGlasner says standards at the club     
OL,8,Gwere not good enough when he arrived,  
OL,9,Gand has questioned why some of his     
OL,10,Gsquad cannot speak English after being 
OL,11,Gin the country for a number of years.  
OL,13,FForest are one place above the         
OL,14,Frelegation zone heading into Friday's  
OL,15,Fhome game against Chelsea, winning     
OL,16,Fjust two of their first 11 games in    
OL,17,Fthe Premier League.                    
